WEBVTT

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.980
Okay, now stretch your Achilles tendon!

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.200
Now the other side!

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.200
<i>I...</i>

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.300
<i>What just happened...?</i>

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:42.130
<i>Don't jump out into the street again.</i>

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.380
Ready when you are!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.170
Shindou-san!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:47.310
How's that?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.390
I'll use a more difficult course next time.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:50.900
Nice.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:52.900
Bring it!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.070
There!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.110
Just as I predicted!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:00.970
Here I go.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:01.570
R-Right!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:05.580
What?

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.020
You almost had it.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.820
It was a calculation error on my part.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.080
But I've already inputted the adjustment values.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:14.790
Next. Let's go!

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.340
Here!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.880
Let's concentrate. Keep a close eye on the ball.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.620
Okay.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.560
Okay, we're having a fifteen minute break!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.820
Hey, Morimura...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.480
What do I do...

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:42.860
Are you still bothered about it?

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.420
Bothered about what?

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.800
Did you do something?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.350
The reason Morimura is acting like that right now...

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.750
...is because I told her she was irritating.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.200
What?! You're so mean!

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.620
Very indelicate.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:04.510
Those words are bound to bring 100% damage to Morimura-san.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.050
I thought so...

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.510
I can't keep on like this in good conscience...

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.310
I have to apologize to her.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.770
Yeah, that would be for the best.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.510
So, what do you plan to do?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.060
Well... she <i>is</i>  avoiding me...

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.660
Why not just casually apologize during practice?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.260
Casually?

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.020
Like, for instance...

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.950
"Hey, the ball is coming your way!"

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.620
"Oh, also, I'm sorry for calling you irritating!"

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.350
Does that count as apologizing?

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.910
You shouldn't apologize offhandedly.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:43.370
Do you think so? But grabbing the moment is important.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.200
Yeah, I think it's fine.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.820
I guess I'll try it.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.730
Breaktime is over!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.480
Just a little more, everyone!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.370
Konoha!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.480
I heard from Captain that you did something amazing yesterday!

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.080
Amazing?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:11.280
You jumped out in front of a truck and saved a cat from getting run over, didn't you?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.660
Oh, that was...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.730
How did you do it? I'd like to know.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.600
How...?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:21.260
Pretend that the ball is a cat and show us!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.240
But...

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.920
Kusaka! Try passing Konoha a ball, would you?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.390
S-Sure!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.970
Are you ready? I'm going to pass it.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.840
A-Also...

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.480
Kusaka...

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.860
I think you should make a proper apology.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.060
I see...

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.240
You're right.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.040
In that case...

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.910
In that case, let's make a situation where you two are alone.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.350
I was just about to say that!

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.500
I have a good idea.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.350
A good idea?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.460
Wait here, and I'll bring Morimura-san to you.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.210
To me?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.110
When she arrives, jump out in front of her.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.950
But once she sees me, she'll run away.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.130
It'll be okay.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:13.800
Morimura-san will most likely be so panicked that she'll be too petrified to move.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.440
That moment will be your chance.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.930
O-Okay...

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.750
All set.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:23.880
Kitty!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.240
No, don't fight!

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.930
I didn't predict how the cat would react...

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:41.680
Hmph!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:44.770
As I thought, it is <i>my</i>  plan that is perfect.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.530
Why are we here?

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.340
Morimura-san loves tree-lined roads.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:58.550
According to my statistical data analysis, there's a 98.74% likelihood that Morimura-san will pass through here in five minutes.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.970
You just have to wait here.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:04.020
Like I said, once she sees me, she'll run away.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.570
No need to worry about that.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:10.640
I calculate a 99.98% likelihood that Morimura-san will freeze up.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.570
Here she is.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.250
Oh, Konoha-chan!

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:23.330
I met you at a good time, a good time!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.770
Please help me carry these.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.370
Okay.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.570
I didn't include Auntie in my calculations...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:43.280
The Football Frontier International V2's Asia district prelims have reached the semifinals!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:48.480
The match between Japan's Inazuma Japan and Thailand's Mach Tiger is about to begin!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.330
You're Inazuma Japan, huh?

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.710
I'm surprised you made it this far.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:54.240
What?

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.740
But we'll be the last ones laughing.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.790
You can do it!

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.460
Make in a shoot!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.600
Now, the match will begin momentarily!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:08.460
What sort of fight will Mach Tiger VS Inazuma Japan show us?!

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.300
There's the kickoff!

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.350
I'll stop you!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.560
Einsatz!

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.610
Now it's Inazuma Japan's turn to attack!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:32.820
That's strange.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.320
Why isn't anyone coming to stop us?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.330
Shindou-san, over here!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:38.530
Okay!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:41.510
Tenma!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:42.240
Yeah!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.960
What a spectacular jump!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:50.340
Now, Tamugan!

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.840
He makes a long pass to the right side!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.590
It's Mach Tiger's turn to counter!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.300
I'll score it in!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.060
He's coming towards me?!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:00.970
Oh shit!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.480
Take this!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:09.820
Don't underestimate me!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.460
It didn't go in!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.400
A nice save by Ibuki!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.400
Yes!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.550
He stopped it.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:22.790
Matatagi!

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:28.290
Another counter by Mach Tiger!

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.060
Here they come!

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.440
We won't let you come close!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.510
Too slow!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.840
Working hard, aren't you.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:46.880
They look like they're aiming for another counter.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:47.890
Manabe. Minaho.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:53.150
In this situation where offense and defense can change in a split-second, a mistake by the defense will end us.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.480
Leave it to us.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.240
This is interesting.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:07.220
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:12.260
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.920
Inazuma Japan attacks aggressively!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.930
Stopping them are Mach Tiger's counters!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.930
It's a battle at its climax!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:28.310
No matter what offense we use, we're met with a counter.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.240
We have to break through their last line of defense somehow.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:36.650
The only way we can score a goal is executing God's Baton with higher precision.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.700
We ought to be able to pull that off now!

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.960
Shindou-san! Now!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.130
Let's go!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.630
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:57.300
Tetsukado!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:10:59.880
Yeah!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.220
Nozaki!

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:03.760
Okay!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:04.930
Tenma!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.040
Okay!

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.060
You won't get through me!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.570
W-What's with him?

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.320
Captain, watch out for his legs!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.330
He can pull off this kind of defense?

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.070
Tenma, over here!

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.150
Fortissimo!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.330
Killer Elbow!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:40.500
Udom blocks it!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:45.170
Not even God's Baton: Fire Illusion led to a goal!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.350
Come on, what are you guys doing?

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.270
Nii-chan! Let Nii-chan score!

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:55.230
Whoa, Matatagi steals the ball!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.610
Whatever the case, we have to score a goal first or we won't get anywhere!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.030
Now!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.500
Parkour Attack!

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.670
He fell for it.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.550
Death Scythe Middle!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:23.460
What?!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:24.630
Go!

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.640
Did Matatagi rush too quickly there?

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.890
He got caught in their web preparing them for a counterattack!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.680
Tighten the defense!

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.310
Defense...

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.230
Move!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.690
This is too easy.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.930
You aren't getting away!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.150
Don't even bother.

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:45.740
Damn it...

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.080
Tamugan!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.300
Yeah!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.700
So they've come at us with this pattern!

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.750
He's faster than I expected!

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:57.750
We won't make it!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:58.710
Come on!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.380
Ivory Crush!

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:09.430
That way?!

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.390
Goal!

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:13.890
Mach Tiger makes the first point!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.640
Damn it...

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.260
I couldn't flawlessly predict their movements...

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.650
My calculations went awry?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:27.750
Inazuma Japan's defense fell apart as a result of Morimura's actions!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:30.150
Will they be able to correct this?

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.060
What do I do...

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.120
It's my fault...

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.310
They're caught up in the other team's pace...

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.380
Coach, we should bring up the defense line!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:48.550
I bet they all hate me now...

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.640
Konoha, he's heading your way!

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.240
Minaho, move closer to your left!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:14.970
Captain...

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:15.950
Yeah?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.500
I want to help Morimura.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.080
Okay, I'm counting on you to cover for her.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.550
That's not what I mean!

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:26.440
What I said so carelessly to her is making her choke up.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.720
I want to do something to help her!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:30.500
Kusaka...

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.720
There's something I want to tell her.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.930
Then now's your chance.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:38.880
Now?

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:43.150
She can't run from the field during a game.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.240
I see...

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:48.860
You're right.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.870
Okay, Captain!

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.340
I like you!

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:18.100
You've got a good heart and a cute face.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.100
I'd want you as my girlfriend, so cheer up!

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.660
Girlfriend?

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:31.320
So the reason he was so bothered about Morimura-san is because he's in love?

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.070
This is why human emotions are so interesting.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.100
That's all I want to say.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:43.840
Someone actually likes someone like me...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.670
Konoha...

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:51.420
What is he doing, right in the middle of a game?!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:57.060
There's always someone who sees the good things about you, even when you can't see them yourself.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.570
Yes.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.310
Defender Napa moves up to attack!

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.080
Those laid-back nutheads.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:10.320
I'll show you that you're on the field of a real head-to-head battle!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.700
He's heading for Morimura again!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.040
Morimura!

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.820
You're able to stop him!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:17.620
Me...?

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.580
I <i>know</i>  you can do it!

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:25.550
I can do it...

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:27.260
Okay.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.300
Your defense won't work on me!

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:37.720
I can see him.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.470
I can move!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.180
Here! Pass the ball!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.480
No!

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:54.150
That's...

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.910
Huh? The ball...

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.910
What? She stopped me?

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.700
She stops him!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.450
Morimura saves the team from danger!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.860
No fair.

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:05.900
She pulled one off before I could.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.170
A hissatsu technique!

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.750
You did it, Konoha-chan!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.930
Konoha, over here!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.130
Okay!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.260
Shindou-san, now!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:19.970
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:22.640
Nozaki!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:25.190
Okay!

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:26.600
Matatagi!

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:28.650
Okay!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:29.860
Tsurugi!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.150
This time Inazuma Japan makes its counterattack!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.530
I won't let you shoot!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.740
Make it in, Kusaka!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.840
Brutal Head!

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.640
Killer Elbow!

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.620
Goal!

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:06.100
Kusaka's shoot brings the score to a tie!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:07.570
Yes!

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:08.600
We caught up!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:10.150
You did it!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.310
Nice reaction.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.460
Let's use this momentum to keep attacking!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.440
Thanks.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:17.780
Nice defense.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:26.750
Only a few minutes remain for the first half, but the fierce fight on the field continues!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.460
With Shindou at their center, Inazuma Japan uses skillful manipulation to bring up the ball!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.730
Mach Tiger makes strong counters to move up to the goal in one motion!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.460
Both teams advance and retreat!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.440
There's still no telling who will rise victorious!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.260
Matatagi!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.350
Okay!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.850
Death Scythe Middle!

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:56.650
Mach Tiger makes another counter!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:57.990
Okay!

00:18:58.260 --> 00:18:59.200
Just as I predicted.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.240
Oh, really?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.200
It's all been calculated!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.170
The first half ends!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:14.710
The climactic battle reaches the second half with both teams at a tie!

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.900
I'll get through you guys next time.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.480
Um...

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.060
Kusaka-kun!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.020
Um... er...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.500
Thank you for your feelings, Kusaka-kun.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:39.330
But about me being your girlfriend...

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.490
Well...

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:41.820
I can't!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.240
I'm sorry!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:48.880
U-Um...

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.700
Oh well.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.670
As long as you're happy, I'm okay with that.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:00.170
Yeah, that's it.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.840
Let's go through life smiling.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.840
You are a man.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:10.820
Konoha-chan.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:12.730
Thanks.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:18.600
I was so surprised, both when Kusaka-kun confessed and when you turned him down.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:21.330
It was all so sudden for me...

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:22.790
Yeah.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:30.620
Once I'm a little more positive, I'll try giving Kusaka-kun's feelings a proper answer.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:39.880
The outcome of who wins and loses will determine destiny, and they're acting so carefree.

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.630
We'll crush them to bits.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.180
Halftime is almost over.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:57.650
The second half of the fateful semifinals between Inazuma Japan and Mach Tiger is ready to begin!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.880
Okay, guys! Let's win this!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.150
Yeah!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.000
What's the matter?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:08.040
I'm a little worried about our fight for the second half.

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:09.830
You too, huh?

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:12.800
Yeah. It's just a feeling, but...

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:18.090
Even though, by adding Morimura-san's defense into our calculations, we have the advantage...

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.440
Manabe. Minaho.

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:56.860
Our seminifinals match against Mach Tiger is a close fight!

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:59.480
The only ones who can break through this deadlock is you, Minaho, Manabe!

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:01.480
Use your reasoning and calculating abilities!

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:03.770
Next, The Answer Key To Victory!

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:06.060
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:19.350
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:25.950
There's always someone who sees the good things about you, even when you can't see them yourself.

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:26.860
That's all!
